{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner2.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this chaotic, physics-based platformer, you and your pals are undead cowboys in a desperate race toward the sky. Trapped in a decaying Wild West, you must climb higher and higher, overcoming deadly obstacles and unstable platforms with only each other to rely on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner3.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your gun not just to shoot, but to launch your pals across gaps, up cliffs, and into danger. Sometimes, the only way up... is to shoot your pal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner1online-video-cutter.com-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not into platforming? No problem\u2014Party Mode is here! Compete in various mini-games and prove you're the new sheriff in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner1.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-driven 3D platforming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with up to 4 players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch your pals or yourself to new heights by bouncing your bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your zombie cowboy with cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A darkly humorous journey from the grave to the clouds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Competitive Party Mode for chaotic fun with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner4online-video-cutter.com-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you and your pals escape this undead purgatory? Or will the climb break your bodies \u2014 and your friendships?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777830?t=1749675327","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3777830?t=1749675327","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/f743f64d401b80d798ffedfb900df33d0584ed85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749675327","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/f743f64d401b80d798ffedfb900df33d0584ed85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749675327","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner2.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this chaotic, physics-based platformer, you and your pals are undead cowboys in a desperate race toward the sky. Trapped in a decaying Wild West, you must climb higher and higher, overcoming deadly obstacles and unstable platforms with only each other to rely on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner3.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your gun not just to shoot, but to launch your pals across gaps, up cliffs, and into danger. Sometimes, the only way up... is to shoot your pal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner1online-video-cutter.com-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not into platforming? No problem\u2014Party Mode is here! Compete in various mini-games and prove you're the new sheriff in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner1.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics-driven 3D platforming gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or with up to 4 players in online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Launch your pals or yourself to new heights by bouncing your bullets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your zombie cowboy with cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A darkly humorous journey from the grave to the clouds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Competitive Party Mode for chaotic fun with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777830/extras/banner4online-video-cutter.com-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1749675327\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you and your pals escape this undead purgatory? Or will the climb b